# Myriad (CR 702.116a) with Doubling Season (CR 614.1a): the one token Bot1 creates for Bot3 is doubled, and for each of the two Bot1
# chooses separately what it attacks (the ruling): the first attacks Bot3's Liliana of the Veil (loyalty 3), the second Bot3 himself.
# Bot2 takes the Patrol's 1, Liliana goes to 2 and Bot3 takes 1.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Emerald
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Doubling Season
Wyrm's Crossing Patrol
Island x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Bot3 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Liliana of the Veil
Swamp x16

